 18:53:37'),(149,67,'Clinical Role & Indications','Sometimes prescribed for GERD/dyspepsia with prominent nausea, fullness or motility symptoms when a clinician considers a prokinetic appropriate.',1,'2026-09-28 18:53:37','2026-09-28 18:53:37'),(150,68,'Clinical Role & Indications','Sometimes prescribed for GERD/dyspepsia with prominent nausea, fullness or motility symptoms when a clinician considers a prokinetic appropriate.',1,'2026-09-28 18:53:37','2026-09-28 18:53:37'),(151,69,'Clinical Role & Indications','Used for acid-related disorders such as GERD, erosive oesophagitis and peptic-ulcer disease; injection is reserved for settings where oral therapy is unsuitable or for specific hospital indications.',1,'2026-09-28 18:53:37','2026-09-28 18:53:37'),(152,70,'Clinical Role & Indications','Sometimes prescribed for GERD/dyspepsia with prominent nausea, fullness or motility symptoms when a clinician considers a prokinetic appropriate.',1,'2026-09-28 18:53:37','2026-09-28 18:53:37'),(153,71,'Clinical Role & Indications','Most commonly used as adjunct nutritional support in PCOS-related metabolic or ovulatory dysfunction; it is not a substitute for evaluation of infertility or endocrine disease.',1,'2026-09-28 18:53:37','2026-09-28 18:53:37'),(154,72,'Clinical Role & Indications','Used for susceptible bacterial ENT, respiratory, urinary, skin and other infections.',1,'2026-09-28 18:53:37','2026-09-28 18:53:37'),(155,73,'Clinical Role & Indications','Used for susceptible bacterial ENT, respiratory, urinary, skin and other infections.',1,'2026-09-28 18:53:37','2026-09-28 18:53:37'),(156,74,'Clinical Role & Indications','Used for susceptible bacterial ENT, respiratory, urinary, skin and other infections.',1,'2026-09-28 18:53:37','2026-09-28 18:53:37'),(157,30,'Clinical Role & Indications','Used for allergic rhinitis/urticarial symptoms when combination therapy is clinically justified; montelukast should not be routine first-line therapy for mild allergic rhinitis because